      "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
      "text": "Elijah said to him, “Elisha, please wait here, for the LORD has sent me to Jericho.” He said, “As the LORD lives, and as your soul lives, I will not leave you.” So they came to Jericho.",
      "textSHA256": "82c5a6605f3537a00b80d9ae972f4e65874c205ae67db6d03add7486446e7fed"
    },
